          dsimp only [Bool.rec, RuleTrie.Valid]
        · exact ⟨trivial, trivial, trivial, hih⟩
        · exact ⟨trivial, hih, trivial, trivial⟩
        · exact ⟨trivial, trivial, trivial, hih⟩
        · exact ⟨trivial, hih, trivial, trivial⟩
        · exact ⟨trivial, trivial, hih, trivial⟩
        · exact ⟨trivial, trivial, hih, trivial⟩
        · exact ⟨hih, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩
        · exact ⟨hih, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩
      · cases Nat.beq (Nat.mod rem_b 2) 0 <;> dsimp only [Bool.rec, RuleTrie.Valid]
        · exact ⟨trivial, ⟨hr, trivial, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩, trivial, ⟨hr, trivial, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩⟩
        · exact ⟨⟨hr, trivial, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩, trivial, ⟨hr, trivial, trivial, trivial, trivial⟩, trivial⟩
